Key Accomplishment: Authentication Handshake This week, the team focused on establishing the secure handshake between the Q2 platform and the Direct Bank SDK. We successfully resolved a mismatch regarding the SSL certificates required for the JWE (JSON Web Encryption) flow.

Certificate Rotation: We facilitated an exchange of updated certificates to align with the required security architecture:

Signature: FCB General Bank provided their updated certificate for signing the JWT.

Encryption: Direct Bank provided our updated certificate for payload encryption.

Validation Success: Using these updated assets, the FCB General Bank team generated a test JWE and shared it with the Direct Bank team. We have successfully decrypted and validated the token on our end, confirming the authentication tunnel is now operational.
